\int_Fg=\int(\chi F)^{\ssbullet}\times g^{\ssbullet}
=(Tv)(\chi F)^{\ssbullet}
=h(\chi F)^{\ssbullet}
=\sup_{E\in\Cal F}\mu(E\cap F)

